# Runexis numbers

The handbook is the live page `https://didapi.runexis.ru/docs/index.html`. Read it again before any Runexis change. It can change. Do not invent methods, paths, or query fields. Do not commit a copy of that page.

The host is the literal `https://didapi.runexis.ru`. HTTPS only. Do not follow redirects. Do not trust a custom certificate. Timeout 30s. Body cap 20 MB.

This release may send only:

- `POST /api/v1/login` with `email` and `password`, once at the start of a walk and once for the access check. It issues a Bearer token and a refresh token. It does not change numbers.
- `POST /api/v1/refresh` with body exactly `{token}` equal to the refresh token, once after a catalog read returns 401, then that same GET once. A 403 does not refresh. Refresh is not used on login.
- `GET /api/v1/numbers/management` with `page` and `limit=30` only. A row is purchased only when `status.mnemonic` is present and is not `free`. A missing status fails the page. A `free` row is counted and is not staged.
- `GET /api/v1/regions/codes` once after the partner list is complete, and once in the access check after that first partner page. The body is a directory of `city_id` and three-digit `codes`. City names and region names are not stored. An empty directory, a body that is not `success: true`, or a code that is not three digits publishes nothing.
- `GET /api/v1/numbers/showcase` with `page`, `limit=1000`, and `region_codes[0]` set to one three-digit code taken from that directory row. `city_ids` is not sent. One code is one request, even when the row lists several codes. The whole page is the free draft. A number that does not start with `7` and that code fails the page.

No unfiltered showcase. No `class_id`, `phone_number`, or `number_status_id`. The values are not taken from a caller, a flag, or a saved catalog. The load reads every management page first. A failed purchased list does not open the code directory or the showcase. A code is stored only when one pass has as many unique numbers as the `meta.total` locked on its first page, and no page of that pass was short. Those rows are inserted in chunks of 500. A changed total, a repeated number on this page or a later page, a hole, or a number from another code discards that pass and reads the code again from page 1. Those reasons share three reads. The third failure drops the draft and leaves both catalogs. A transport failure, a timeout, an HTTP error, a `meta.limit` other than 1000, or a number that cannot be stored stops the walk on that request. The same `e164` on a later code stays one row. A purchased number stays purchased. Do not delete stored rows by prefix. Both catalogs are replaced only after every code succeeds and at least one free number was staged. A walk that stages no free number publishes nothing. The access check reads page 1 of management, then the code directory, then page 1 of the showcase for the first code of the first directory row. A page that cannot be parsed, a number that does not start with that code, or a page shorter than `min(meta.total, 1000)` is not access. An empty total with no rows is access. The password, the token, and the refresh token stay out of logs, the database, and responses. A JSON `message` from an HTTP 400 or an HTTP 500 may be added to the operator error, at most 200 characters. It is dropped when it contains `://`, `bearer`, `password`, `token`, or `key=`. HTTP 400 is one attempt, including when its body cannot be read. The body stays out of the log.

Do not call `revoke-all`, `buy`, `book`, `allocate`, `refuse`, `GET /api/v1/numbers`, `GET /api/v1/internal/numbers`, `GET /api/v1/regions`, or `GET /api/v1/regions/cities`. Do not call the old Numbering API.

A successful walk replaces every `free_numbers` row and every `purchased_numbers` row whose provider is `Runexis`, in one transaction. SipOut rows stay. Free-number prices may fill «Покупка» and «Абонплата». Purchased `installationCost` is «Покупка» and `subscriptionFee` is «Абонплата». `meraPrice` is not stored on a purchased number. A null, negative, non-decimal, or scientific price leaves that cell empty and the number stays. Category and class are not stored. The Runexis lease and draft are their own tables. Do not use `numbering_sync_state` or `numbering_sync_stage`. The stage log names the code, the page, the attempt, the HTTP status, the attempts, and the duration. When the total changes it names both integers and no phone number. It is synced at the end of a code, after a discarded pass, and on failure. It has no password, token, or URL.
